OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 13, who was struck by car,
OL,4,A'had smile that lit up a room', inquest
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe father of a 13-year-old girl who
OL,8,Fdied after being
OL,10,FThe inquest into Caitlin Hogg's death
OL,11,Ffound she died on 8 December 2022, as a
OL,12,Fresult of a traumatic brain injury
OL,13,Fcaused by the collision two days
OL,14,Fearlier on 6 December, on the Moher
OL,15,FRoad, Kinawley, in County Fermanagh.
OL,17,FCoroner Joe McCrisken delivered the
OL,18,Ffindings of the inquest at Enniskillen
OL,19,Fcourthouse on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
